# Files aeview should never review (gitignore-style; matched at any depth).
# Local-only, gitignored working docs (implementation_log.local.md,
# changes_to_be_made_to_vscode_variant.local.md, *.local.json, …) — mirrors
# the `*.local*` rule in .gitignore. They're untracked so git-scoped diffs
# already skip them; this also covers working-tree/untracked review scopes.
*.local.*
